        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 He ’maan kanmeile, ngalanc guang dat tho,",
            "Chu lo, Lauziu Gaenghmeipu kaw bam the;",
            "Nang ta gulou khang, tii’than khang ’khwan bam,",
            "Katumcna Kata laa tho, nyan ri tho!",
            "",
            "Niamh gayna kaw bam,",
            "’khaengv thayna huay bam,",
            "Lauziu Ganghmeipu",
            "nang ta kaw e;",
            "Niamh gayna kaw bam ’khaengv",
            "thayna ’khwan bam,",
            "Zianna kaw bam the,",
            "“ Akhouguang o.”",
            "",
            "2 Kamei ’khwan bam the, bui khang nang ’maan ni?",
            "Lauziu kuanc khou ({0 maeng duc khwan sihni,",
            "Kazei keylouna nang ta thuak lou the;",
            "Rac ngam thuy lakmei ch’rynmei zauzian e!",
            "",
            "3 Kalat 0({ ’king o, Kazauzian chak go!",
            "Paapc maekmei pu ({0 nang paap phungclou the;",
            "Ringcsuangmei panty, ’thuihmei kuakloumei,",
            "Kamei theicloupui paan ({0 tiilou the.",
            "",
            "4 Guang o, chaengguang khou, nchumhpui chaeng khou,",
            "Jisu chaengmun e, Kakhou ({0 gut ro;",
            "Lauziu Gaengc-chuymeipu kiu Kamei e;",
            "’Suan sihni guang o, tat ’maan dat ri tho."
          ]
        }
      }
